{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/ss_581be48ae2bdf7d746e4d4b5b98b05ce055871c0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1743704596\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dead World is a first-person action game that immerses you in a post-apocalyptic world in devastated Argentina.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story 1: THE LOST WAGON</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/11.png?t=1743704596\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Carlos and Miguel on a mission to investigate the disappearance of a wagon that was supposed to arrive in the community of San Diego, Entre R\u00edos. Their journey will lead them to face unexpected challenges as they uncover hidden secrets in the ruins of a destroyed country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story 2: GINO'S JOURNEY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/HighresScreenshot00022.png?t=1743704596\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gino, a schnauzer from La Payunia, Mendoza, is the last of his kind. When he encounters a female of his breed in a remote settlement, Daniel and Manuel decide to embark on a dangerous journey to save the schnauzer breed, facing mutants and other dangers along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story 3: RULETITA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/HighresScreenshot00025.png?t=1743704596\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After being surrounded by mutants, two friends must face their destiny. This story features critical decisions that will influence the outcome, offering multiple endings based on the player's choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MAIN FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story Diversity:</strong> Experience different narratives that explore the diverse facets of the Dead World.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deep Exploration:</strong> Traverse detailed environments in search of resources vital to your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging Combat:</strong> Face off against mutants and bandits using a wide variety of weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roguelite Mode:</strong> Test your skills in &quot;A Rogue's Tale,&quot; where survival depends on your decisions and skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in Dead World and see if you can survive in a world where every step could be your last.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The lost wagon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1376960/0a71ee7d8eb851d98317ae102734465bcac207c1.jpg"},{"name":"Hight quality weed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1376960/bb1c99041365ac3fff72d681fba19d04b2a00f52.jpg"},{"name":"No windows","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1376960/e8eccaf856fdcef9463a73938893fa33b94c584a.jpg"},{"name":"The job is complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1376960/f36d5b1a82b2badb59d7924e2a169dcb1b596b71.jpg"},{"name":"What was that?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1376960/839aa6a785dad0e41f1fa0cc81d9d7b8a229d5b3.jpg"},{"name":"Oid mortales...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1376960/2e9ea39cf26d19e42fb54c43ae3c3c44982dc4e8.jpg"},{"name":"Cool killer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1376960/bad3a6fdbfd33fc283962474555a74b088100ca5.jpg"},{"name":"Very cool killer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1376960/bad3a6fdbfd33fc283962474555a74b088100ca5.jpg"},{"name":"Hornero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1376960/9c6dd98f6dd5e746d5b0099910a2a18a367df4d0.jpg"},{"name":"Ruletita","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1376960/15ba4d6caf7229d0be45ba788de20c81f3a4122e.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1376960?t=1743704596","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743704596","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/9b9daf0330d0ece02fd3fcf8d45f250834a83b35/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743704596","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/9b9daf0330d0ece02fd3fcf8d45f250834a83b35/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743704596","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":1512580,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/ss_581be48ae2bdf7d746e4d4b5b98b05ce055871c0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1743704596\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dead World is a first-person action game that immerses you in a post-apocalyptic world in devastated Argentina.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story 1: THE LOST WAGON</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/11.png?t=1743704596\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Carlos and Miguel on a mission to investigate the disappearance of a wagon that was supposed to arrive in the community of San Diego, Entre R\u00edos. Their journey will lead them to face unexpected challenges as they uncover hidden secrets in the ruins of a destroyed country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story 2: GINO'S JOURNEY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/HighresScreenshot00022.png?t=1743704596\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gino, a schnauzer from La Payunia, Mendoza, is the last of his kind. When he encounters a female of his breed in a remote settlement, Daniel and Manuel decide to embark on a dangerous journey to save the schnauzer breed, facing mutants and other dangers along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story 3: RULETITA</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/extras/HighresScreenshot00025.png?t=1743704596\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After being surrounded by mutants, two friends must face their destiny. This story features critical decisions that will influence the outcome, offering multiple endings based on the player's choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MAIN FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story Diversity:</strong> Experience different narratives that explore the diverse facets of the Dead World.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deep Exploration:</strong> Traverse detailed environments in search of resources vital to your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging Combat:</strong> Face off against mutants and bandits using a wide variety of weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roguelite Mode:</strong> Test your skills in &quot;A Rogue's Tale,&quot; where survival depends on your decisions and skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in Dead World and see if you can survive in a world where every step could be your last.</p>","developers":["Milanesa Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1376960/header.jpg?t=1743704596","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257119751,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119751/movie480.mp4?t=1743556393","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119751/movie_max.mp4?t=1743556393"},"name":"Dead World | Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257119751/077d96ef433ef2969e669ee1211b0348ca69b8f0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743556393","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119751/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743556393","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257119751/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743556393"}}],"name":"Dead World","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Dead World - $2.99 USD","packa